                            <pick-existing-process>Link to existing custom process:</pick-existing-process>
                            <section-label-icon>Label &amp; Icon</section-label-icon>
                            <profiled-resources-note>Button labels (oxf.fr.resource.*) apply across profiles; switch to the unprofiled scope to edit labels.</profiled-resources-note>
